{{!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
     navbar/links — the top bar's items, with dropdowns.
     ------------------------------------------------------------------------
     Rendered through partials/navigation.hbs — read the warning there about
     why this cannot be called directly.

     ── DROPDOWNS COME FROM GHOST ADMIN ──────────────────────────────────────
     In Admin → Settings → Navigation, prefix a label with "-" to nest it
     under the item above it:

         Courses            →  top-level
         -Administrator     →  a child of Courses
         -Developer         →  a child of Courses
         Blog               →  top-level again

     Ghost's navigation is a FLAT list with no nesting of its own, so the tree
     is rebuilt here. {{#match label "~^" "-"}} is Ghost's own startsWith
     operator, so the structure is in the HTML and works with scripting off.

     ── HOW THE FLAT LIST BECOMES NESTED ─────────────────────────────────────
     Handlebars cannot look ahead, so each PARENT closes the previous parent's
     <li> before opening its own, and the loop is closed once at the end. The
     tags therefore look unbalanced read top to bottom. They are not — they
     balance across iterations. Do not "fix" this by moving a closing tag
     inside the block.

     ── THE WHITESPACE CONTROL IS LOAD-BEARING ───────────────────────────────
     Every tag uses {{~ ~}}. A parent with no children must produce a
     literally EMPTY .ns-navmenu so `:empty` matches and theme/navbar.css can
     hide its caret. One stray newline inside that div and every item in the
     bar grows a caret that opens nothing.

     Behaviour is assets/js/nav.js, vendored from NSDS: it flips
     aria-expanded. Every item is a real link either way.
     ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ --}}
<ul class="ns-topnav__links">
    {{~#foreach navigation}}
        {{~#match label "~^" "-"~}}
            <a class="ns-navmenu__item" href="{{url absolute="true"}}" {{#if current}}aria-current="page"{{/if}}><span class="ns-navmenu__icon">{{> "navbar/icon"}}</span><span><span class="ns-navmenu__title">{{> "navbar/label"}}</span></span></a>
        {{~else~}}
            {{~#unless @first}}</div></li>{{/unless~}}
            <li class="ns-navitem"><a class="ns-topnav__link" href="{{url absolute="true"}}" {{#if current}}aria-current="page"{{/if}}>{{> "navbar/icon"}} {{> "navbar/label"}}</a><button type="button" class="ns-topnav__trigger" data-ns-menu aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="nav-{{slug}}" aria-label="{{t "Show submenu"}}"></button><div class="ns-navmenu" id="nav-{{slug}}">
        {{~/match~}}
    {{~/foreach~}}
    {{~#if navigation}}</div></li>{{/if~}}
</ul>
